  "notes": "Years are counted nationally as Schulstufen 1–12; within each school learners count classes again from 1 (Schulstufe 5 is the 1st class of Mittelschule or AHS; Schulstufe 9 is the 5th class of AHS). Upper secondary shown is the four-year AHS-Oberstufe; BHS colleges (HTL, HAK and others) last five years and end after Schulstufe 13, and the one-year Polytechnische Schule covers Schulstufe 9. The optional Vorschulstufe is pre-primary and excluded."
